Refused: additionalProperties true on an inline object property, whose
struct keeps no other keys (0019-PLAN-generator-hardening.md, G2).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "Outer": {"type": "object", "properties": {"inner": {"type": "object", "properties": {"a": {"type": "string"}}, "additionalProperties": true}}},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
